  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;Airport Communication Project - Phase VI (AIRCOP VI)&apos;&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The present proposed Action, entitled &#xbf;Establishment of real-time operational communication and strengthening of anti-trafficking capacity between international airports (AIRCOP VI)&#xbf;, aims at paving the way to ensure that AIRCOP Joint Airport Interdiction Task Forces are stable, efficient, and nationally recognized stand-alone institutions, equipped, with all the necessary tools (especially in terms of training) and proper means of communication and exchanges with partners around the world.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
